A spectral sequence which fails to degenerate quickly
*****************************************************

The following example is taken from p. 127, Fig 7.2 of Zomorodian's Topology
for computing.  In that figure, a filtration of a suitable simplicial complex
is pictured.  Here we compute the associated spectral sequence. As we will see
below, the spectral sequences has nonzero maps on higher page numbers.

