associatedGradedHomologyObject -- compute the associated graded homology object
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        M = associatedGradedHomologyObject(ZZ, ZZ, FilteredComplex)
  * Inputs:
      * p, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * K, a *note filtered chain complex: FilteredComplex,, 
  * Outputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 

Description
===========

Computes the associated graded homology object determined by the filtered chain
complex

Ways to use associatedGradedHomologyObject:
===========================================

  * "associatedGradedHomologyObject(ZZ,ZZ,FilteredComplex)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note associatedGradedHomologyObject:
associatedGradedHomologyObject, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

