|                                                      |
|      1      2      1                                 |
|o2 = A  <-- A  <-- A                                  |
|                                                      |
|     0      1      2                                  |
|                                                      |
|o2 : Complex                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = filteredComplex C                            |
|                                                      |
|o3 = -1 : image 0 <-- image 0 <-- image 0             |
|                                                      |
|          0           1           2                   |
|                                                      |
|     0 : image | 1 | <-- image 0 <-- image 0          |
|                                                      |
|         0               1           2                |
|                                                      |
|     1 : image | 1 | <-- image {1} | 1 0 | <-- image 0|
|                               {1} | 0 1 |            |
|         0                                     2      |
|                         1                            |
|                                                      |
|          1      2      1                             |
|     2 : A  <-- A  <-- A                              |
|                                                      |
|         0      1      2                              |
|                                                      |
|o3 : FilteredComplex                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+

