hilbertPolynomial(SpectralSequencePage) -- the Hilbert polynomial of a spectral sequence page
*********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note hilbertPolynomial: (Macaulay2Doc)hilbertPolynomial,
  * Usage: 
        H = hilbertPolynomial(E)
  * Inputs:
      * E, a *note spectral sequence page: SpectralSequencePage,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Projective: (Macaulay2Doc)hilbertPolynomial_lp_pd_pd_pd_
        cmProjective=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value true,
  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note Page: Page,, 

Description
===========

Returns the Hilbert polynomials of all modules of the spectral sequence page

As a specific example consider the filtered complex $K$ below, obtained by
multiplying the minimal free resolution of the rational quartic space curve by
successive powers of the irrelevant ideal.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = QQ[a..d];                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J = ideal vars B;                                |
|                                                      |
|o2 : Ideal of B                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C = freeResolution monomialCurveIdeal(B,{1,3,4});|
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : K = filteredComplex(J,C,4);                      |
+------------------------------------------------------+

We compute the degree $0$ piece of the $E^3$ page below.

+----------------------------------+
|i5 : E = prune spectralSequence K;|
+----------------------------------+
|i6 : hilbertPolynomial(E^3)       |
|                                  |
|     +-------------+              |
|o6 = |- 3*P  + 4*P |              |
|     |     0      1|              |
|     |             |              |
|     |{-4, 4}      |              |
|     +-------------+              |
|                                  |
|o6 : Page                         |
+----------------------------------+

