I-adic filtrations of chain complexes and their spectral sequences
******************************************************************

By multiplying a chain complex by successive powers of an ideal we obtain a
filtered complex.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = QQ[a..d]                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
