inducedMap(FilteredComplex,ZZ) -- the i th inclusion map in a filtered complex
******************************************************************************

  * Function: *note inducedMap: (Macaulay2Doc)inducedMap,
  * Usage: 
        f = inducedMap(K,i)
  * Inputs:
      * K, a *note filtered chain complex: FilteredComplex,, 
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
