        rp, => ..., default value null,
      * *note Verify: (Macaulay2Doc)inducedMap_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVerify=>_pd_pd_pd_
        rp, => ..., default value true,
  * Outputs:
      * f, a *note map of complexes: (Complexes)ComplexMap,, 

Description
===========

Returns the chain complex map specifying the inclusion of the i piece of the
filtered complex to the ambient chain complex.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ[x,y];                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = koszulComplex vars A;                        |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = filteredComplex C                            |
|                                                      |
|o3 = -1 : image 0 <-- image 0 <-- image 0             |
|                                                      |
|          0           1           2                   |
|                                                      |
|     0 : image | 1 | <-- image 0 <-- image 0          |
|                                                      |
|         0               1           2                |
|                                                      |
|     1 : image | 1 | <-- image {1} | 1 0 | <-- image 0|
|                               {1} | 0 1 |            |
|         0                                     2      |
|                         1                            |
|                                                      |
|          1      2      1                             |
|     2 : A  <-- A  <-- A                              |
|                                                      |
|         0      1      2                              |
|                                                      |
