netPage -- display a small portion of a given Spectral Sequence page
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        E' = netPage(E,L1,L2)
  * Inputs:
      * E, a *note Page: Page,, 
      * L1, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
      * L2, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * Outputs:
      * E', a *note net: (Macaulay2Doc)Net,, 

Description
===========

Produces the portion of a given spectral sequence page that lies in the square
with given bottom right and top left coordinates.

+---------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x];                              |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = R/ideal"x2";                        |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i3 : N = S^1/ideal"x";                       |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i4 : M = R^1/R_0;                            |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C = freeResolution M;                   |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i6 : C' = C ** S;                            |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i7 : D = freeResolution(N,LengthLimit => 10);|
+---------------------------------------------+
|i8 : E0 = C' ** (filteredComplex D);         |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i9 : E = prune spectralSequence E0;          |
+---------------------------------------------+

The E_2 page has nonzero E_2^{p,q} when 0 <= p <= 10 and 0 <= q <= 1, so we may
ask to restrict the display to 2 <= p <= 6 and 0 <= q <= 1.

netPage(E_2,{2,0},{6,1})

If we ask for a square that is too large, only the relevant portion of the page
will be displayed.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : R = QQ[x];                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : S = R/ideal"x2";                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : N = S^1/ideal"x";                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : M = R^1/R_0;                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : C = freeResolution M;                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : C' = C ** S;                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : D = freeResolution(N,LengthLimit => 10);                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i17 : E0 = C' ** (filteredComplex D);                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i18 : E = prune spectralSequence E0;                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i19 : netPage(E_2,{-5,0},{7,1})                                              |
|                                                                             |
|      +------------------+------------------+------------------+-------------|
|o19 = |cokernel {2} | x ||cokernel {3} | x ||cokernel {4} | x ||cokernel {5} |
|      |                  |                  |                  |             |
|      |{0, 1}            |{1, 1}            |{2, 1}            |{3, 1}       |
|      +------------------+------------------+------------------+-------------|
|      |cokernel | x |    |cokernel {1} | x ||cokernel {2} | x ||cokernel {3} |
