SpectralSequence ^ ZZ -- the kth page of a spectral sequence
************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ^: (Macaulay2Doc)^,
  * Usage: 
        P = E^k
  * Inputs:
      * E, a *note spectral sequence: SpectralSequence,, 
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * P, a *note spectral sequence page: SpectralSequencePage,, 

Description
===========

Returns the kth page of the spectral sequence.

Consider the filtered complex $K$ below, obtained by multiplying the minimal
free resolution of the rational quartic space curve by successive powers of the
irrelevant ideal.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = QQ[a..d];                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J = ideal vars B;                                |
|                                                      |
|o2 : Ideal of B                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C = freeResolution monomialCurveIdeal(B,{1,3,4});|
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : K = filteredComplex(J,C,4);                      |
+------------------------------------------------------+

Let $E$ be the spectral sequence determined by $K$.

+----------------------------+
|i5 : E = spectralSequence K;|
+----------------------------+

