SpectralSequencePage ^ List -- the module in the i,j position on the page
*************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ^: (Macaulay2Doc)^,
  * Usage: 
        M = P^L
  * Inputs:
      * P, a *note spectral sequence page: SpectralSequencePage,, 
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, A list L = \{i,j\} of integers
  * Outputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 

Description
===========

Returns the module in the \{i,j\}  \ position in the spectral sequence page.
(Using cohomological or upper indexing conventions.)  The relationship
$E^{-i,-j} = E_{i,j}$ holds.

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ[x,y]                                 |
|                                                 |
|o1 = A                                           |
|                                                 |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                              |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = koszulComplex vars A;                   |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = filteredComplex C;                      |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : E = spectralSequence K                      |
|                                                 |
|o4 = E                                           |
|                                                 |
|o4 : SpectralSequence                            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : E_0                                         |
|                                                 |
|     +-----------------+-----------------+------+|
|     |                 |                 | 1    ||
|o5 = |image | 1 0 0 0 ||image {1} | 1 0 ||A     ||
|     |                 |      {1} | 0 1 ||      ||
|     |{0, 0}           |                 |{2, 0}||
|     |                 |{1, 0}           |      ||
|     +-----------------+-----------------+------+|
|                                                 |
|o5 : SpectralSequencePage                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : E_0 ^{-1,0}                                 |
|                                                 |
|o6 = image {1} | 1 0 |                           |
|           {1} | 0 1 |                           |
|                                                 |
|                             2                   |
|o6 : A-module, submodule of A                    |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : E^0 _{1,0}                                  |
|                                                 |
|o7 = image {1} | 1 0 |                           |
|           {1} | 0 1 |                           |
|                                                 |
|                             2                   |
|o7 : A-module, submodule of A                    |
