spectralSequencePage(FilteredComplex,ZZ) -- construct a spectral sequence page from a filtered complex
******************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note spectralSequencePage: spectralSequencePage,
  * Usage: 
        E = spectralSequencePage(K,r)
  * Inputs:
      * K, a *note filtered chain complex: FilteredComplex,, A filtered complex
      * r, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Prune: spectralSequencePage_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmPrune=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
