SpectralSequencePageMap _ List -- The p,q th map on of a spectral sequence page
*******************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        d = D _L
  * Inputs:
      * D, a *note spectral sequence page map: SpectralSequencePageMap,, 
