|                                       |
|      2      1                         |
|o4 = A  <-- A                          |
|                                       |
|     1      2                          |
|                                       |
|o4 : Complex                           |
+---------------------------------------+
|i5 : spots D                           |
|                                       |
|o5 = {1, 2}                            |
|                                       |
